      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe 2 instances where sciatic nerve block prevented pain in the sciatic nerve distribution caused by the nerve-root tension test in patients with radiculopathy. We hypothesize that antidromic activation of nociceptors from the injured root is a mechanism underlying sciatica."},
